Two entries of Nezha's fault list for 2022-08-22 (Online Boutique, dataset1), unchanged, and a
few log rows from either side of the first of them (a thrown exception in the frontend), cut to
the time, pod and log record as `aria data download` stores them but not gzipped. One row is
repeated in both minute files, to test that a line two files hold is read once.

